<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107924" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερφαίνομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>appear, show
				oneself over</i> or <i>above,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ λόφου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.93
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ποταμοῦ,</span> i.e. on its
			bank, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pyrrh.</u>
				16
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				550b3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Euph.
				44
			</span></i>: also c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τὰ τείχη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Dio</u>
					39
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>appear in the air above,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				620b2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.62d
			</span></i>:—so in 
				Act.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοιοὶ δὲ σκυνίοισιν ὑπερφαίνουσι
					μέτωπον οἷα τύλοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					177
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>to be superior,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1.11a
			</span></i>.</div>
